WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.846
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.116 --> 00:13.118
[♪ opening theme music playing]

3
00:13.201 --> 00:14.661
[bird screeching]

4
00:38.143 --> 00:40.771
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

5
00:43.106 --> 00:45.025
[♪ gentle music playing]

6
00:45.108 --> 00:48.153
[soft footsteps echoing]

7
01:15.639 --> 01:17.974
Are you a good dancer, Your Majesty?

8
01:28.568 --> 01:29.569
I'd say so.

9
01:39.413 --> 01:40.539
Can you hold your own?

10
01:45.001 --> 01:46.795
I will glide along with you.

11
02:10.277 --> 02:12.612
[♪ music continues]

12
02:25.834 --> 02:27.210
[stammers] Wait…

13
02:34.342 --> 02:35.635
[stammers]

14
02:36.511 --> 02:38.013
-[Albani scoffs] -If you step on my foot,

15
02:38.096 --> 02:39.556
I'll pretend not to notice.

16
02:40.974 --> 02:42.726
That won't happen, Your Highness.

17
02:42.809 --> 02:44.436
[chuckles] Do not worry.

18
02:45.061 --> 02:46.938
I'm very tight-lipped, Your Majesty.

19
02:55.363 --> 02:56.656
Dancing with you

20
02:57.574 --> 02:58.825
is truly my honor.

21
03:06.124 --> 03:08.126
[♪ slow waltz music playing]

22
03:39.282 --> 03:41.076
The honor is mine.

23
03:42.327 --> 03:44.287
Ladies have lost sleep, I'm certain…

24
03:44.996 --> 03:47.707
wondering with whom you would share your first dance.

25
03:49.042 --> 03:52.921
Are you saying Your Majesty was not looking forward to dancing with me?

26
03:54.005 --> 03:55.882
Ah! Are you married by chance?

27
03:55.966 --> 03:58.051
[Navier chuckles]

28
03:58.635 --> 03:59.761
What a shame.

29
04:23.451 --> 04:26.121
[♪ music continues]

30
04:42.804 --> 04:43.972
[♪ music fades]

31
04:49.394 --> 04:51.938
[♪ dramatic music playing]

32
05:02.991 --> 05:04.993
[guests gasping, exclaiming]

33
05:05.660 --> 05:06.995
[noblewoman] He's so dashing. Just look at him!

34
05:08.163 --> 05:10.206
[♪ music continues]

35
05:26.473 --> 05:27.974
Well done.

36
05:31.519 --> 05:32.520
Why?

37
05:32.604 --> 05:35.482
Just keep on looking at me like that.

38
05:47.077 --> 05:48.912
[♪ waltz music playing]

39
06:37.460 --> 06:39.212
[♪ music continues]

40
07:05.488 --> 07:06.698
[laughing]

41
07:39.689 --> 07:40.982
[♪ music swells]

42
07:55.079 --> 07:56.915
[♪ music fades]

43
08:20.438 --> 08:22.440
[guests cheering and clapping]

44
08:34.828 --> 08:35.995
[Laura giggling]

45
09:06.151 --> 09:08.611
[♪ gentle waltz music playing]

46
09:17.537 --> 09:18.872
May I have the next dance?

47
09:33.887 --> 09:34.888
What is she doing?

48
09:35.471 --> 09:36.890
Why is Ms. Rashta going over there?

49
09:37.307 --> 09:38.308
Don't do it.

50
09:41.853 --> 09:44.063
[Rashta] So, I was thinking…

51
09:44.147 --> 09:47.483
Rashta and Prince Heinrey can share the next dance together.

52
09:53.364 --> 09:54.616
[chuckles awkwardly]

53
09:58.536 --> 09:59.787
Forgive me.

54
09:59.871 --> 10:03.416
I want to cherish the dance I shared with Her Majesty as my last for today.

55
10:07.587 --> 10:10.298
[nobles snickering]

56
10:15.261 --> 10:16.846
What does she think she's doing?

57
10:16.930 --> 10:19.098
[gasps] Goodness! Ugh!

58
10:19.182 --> 10:20.558
Earlier…

59
10:21.684 --> 10:24.938
what were you discussing with the Prince of the Western Kingdom?

60
10:25.021 --> 10:26.522
A few pleasantries, nothing more.

61
10:27.065 --> 10:28.066
[scoffs]

62
10:29.943 --> 10:33.321
Have you never heard the rumors that circulate about him?

63
10:33.404 --> 10:36.032
How could you have an ordinary conversation with a man like that?

64
10:36.616 --> 10:38.159
He is an amusing character.

65
10:38.243 --> 10:40.286
[scoffs] Being a notorious womanizer,

66
10:40.954 --> 10:42.080
I would imagine he is.

67
10:44.874 --> 10:47.043
I know some womanizers who are not.

68
10:53.675 --> 10:56.636
[clicks tongue, inhales] Well, I suppose I cannot forbid you

69
10:56.719 --> 11:00.139
to take a lover of your own since I have taken a mistress myself.

70
11:00.223 --> 11:01.266
Still…

71
11:02.308 --> 11:04.269
I wouldn't recommend Heinrey as your choice.

72
11:04.978 --> 11:06.521
Would you please speak more plainly?

73
11:06.604 --> 11:08.564
If you carry on like this,

74
11:08.648 --> 11:10.775
I dare say you would not be calling him your lover,

75
11:11.317 --> 11:15.363
but rather, it is yourself who will be a mistress to this man.

76
11:18.032 --> 11:20.326
You know, you are the Empress of--

77
11:20.410 --> 11:22.578
I'm not certain I understand your meaning.

78
11:23.705 --> 11:26.082
However, nothing of that sort will happen.

79
11:29.335 --> 11:30.420
How wise of you.

80
11:30.503 --> 11:34.173
For the Empress to become the object of reckless flirtation

81
11:34.257 --> 11:35.800
with a man who toys with every woman he sees

82
11:35.883 --> 11:36.926
is not dignified.

83
11:39.304 --> 11:41.431
[♪ lively waltz music playing]

84
11:47.812 --> 11:49.105
[Rashta sobbing]

85
11:53.276 --> 11:54.736
[Rashta continues sobbing]

86
11:54.819 --> 11:55.903
Rashta.

87
11:58.114 --> 11:59.699
[Rashta continues sobbing]

88
12:07.415 --> 12:08.541
Rashta.

89
12:09.042 --> 12:11.127
Your Majesty. [whimpers]

90
12:11.210 --> 12:12.754
What is it?

91
12:12.837 --> 12:15.840
Never leave Rashta behind again.

92
12:15.923 --> 12:17.175
Oh, it's all right.

93
12:19.552 --> 12:21.179
Look at this. What do you think is going on?

94
12:21.262 --> 12:22.305
Yes, what is it?

95
12:22.388 --> 12:25.767
Someone said she had the nerve to spread a rumor about poor Rashta.

96
12:25.850 --> 12:28.478
-[gasps] -Saying she was a runaway slave.

97
12:28.561 --> 12:29.979
Ah, well, even so!

98
12:30.063 --> 12:32.815
Who would have thought the dignified Empress would do that?

99
12:32.899 --> 12:35.026
-[noblewoman 1] What did I tell you? -[noblewoman 2] That is so scary.

100
12:35.109 --> 12:37.195
-[noblewoman 3] Her Majesty is jealous! -[noblewoman 2] That's so scary.

101
12:37.278 --> 12:39.155
[noblewoman 3] They say Her Majesty has actually been

102
12:39.238 --> 12:41.324
showering that woman with all kinds of gifts.

103
12:41.407 --> 12:43.659
You're saying behind the scenes, she's scheming?

104
12:43.743 --> 12:45.661
-Oh! How embarrassing. -[all laughing]

105
12:45.745 --> 12:47.872
-I guess it shows what she's really like. -Oh!

106
12:47.955 --> 12:48.956
[exclaims]

107
12:49.040 --> 12:50.583
-Oh! Oh, oh. -What is this?

108
12:50.666 --> 12:51.709
Are you all right?

109
12:51.793 --> 12:53.461
[stammering]

110
12:54.087 --> 12:56.255
Oh, Your… Your Highness.

111
12:56.339 --> 12:57.799
[giggles nervously] I'm fine.

112
12:57.882 --> 12:59.300
Yeah.

113
12:59.384 --> 13:00.551
Why'd you push?

114
13:02.929 --> 13:04.055
It was a mistake.

115
13:04.889 --> 13:05.890
Sorry, Your Majesty.

116
13:05.973 --> 13:08.101
Oh, honestly, that made me startled.

117
13:08.184 --> 13:10.144
[sighs] So sorry.

118
13:10.228 --> 13:11.270
[giggles]

119
13:11.354 --> 13:12.980
[indistinct conversation]

120
13:13.064 --> 13:14.649
[Rashta laughing]

121
13:15.691 --> 13:17.485
Just look at those two over there.

122
13:18.194 --> 13:20.863
Why is she walking around as though she's the host?

123
13:20.947 --> 13:23.658
This New Year's Ceremony is something Her Majesty prepared

124
13:23.741 --> 13:25.201
with everything she had.

125
13:30.039 --> 13:32.291
[♪ moody music playing]

126
13:46.889 --> 13:47.974
[birds chirping]

127
14:10.121 --> 14:11.205
[wings flapping]

128
14:13.666 --> 14:14.959
[♪ bright, playful music playing]

129
14:16.335 --> 14:18.171
[chuckles] Queen!

130
14:18.254 --> 14:19.797
[chirping]

131
14:19.881 --> 14:21.299
[chuckles softly] Will you join?

132
14:23.176 --> 14:24.343
[laughing]

133
14:26.262 --> 14:27.680
[bird chirping]

134
14:29.765 --> 14:31.017
Your Highness.

135
14:34.353 --> 14:35.438
[chirps]

136
14:35.521 --> 14:37.440
What are you doing here?

137
14:38.274 --> 14:39.942
-Go away! -[bird chirps in surprise]

138
14:41.194 --> 14:42.653
[bird screeches]

139
14:42.737 --> 14:44.780
[Queen chirping]

140
14:46.282 --> 14:47.366
[chuckles] What's wrong?

141
14:55.583 --> 14:56.709
[sighs]

142
14:56.792 --> 14:58.377
Let me hold you, Queen.

143
14:59.503 --> 15:01.964
[♪ gentle music playing]

144
15:03.883 --> 15:04.884
Mmm.

145
15:05.718 --> 15:07.345
-You're warm, Queen. -[chirps]

146
15:07.428 --> 15:08.429
Thank you…

147
15:10.097 --> 15:11.224
for being here.

148
15:14.143 --> 15:15.895
I have strength because of you.

149
15:17.188 --> 15:19.148
[♪ happy music playing]

150
15:19.232 --> 15:20.650
[chirping]

151
15:20.733 --> 15:22.568
[chuckles softly]

152
15:27.240 --> 15:28.950
You're very human-like.

153
15:30.326 --> 15:31.577
[chirps]

154
15:34.705 --> 15:36.207
You'll return home soon.

155
15:36.290 --> 15:38.751
Once the Ceremony ends, you'll go back with your master.

156
15:40.753 --> 15:42.338
What will I do without you?

157
15:43.839 --> 15:44.840
[chirps]

158
15:45.549 --> 15:46.550
Hmm?

159
15:51.013 --> 15:52.265
[Heinrey] "Let's wager Queen."

160
15:53.015 --> 15:54.141
[gasps]

161
15:54.725 --> 15:55.726
Queen…

162
15:56.352 --> 15:57.478
the note says to wager you.

163
16:00.147 --> 16:03.401
"P.S. You did attend the Ceremony, did you not?

164
16:04.485 --> 16:06.904
Perhaps you were among the…

165
16:07.655 --> 16:09.448
ladies that I danced with."

166
16:23.754 --> 16:26.090
Are you a good dancer, Your Majesty?

167
16:36.684 --> 16:38.311
[♪ captivating music playing]

168
16:46.193 --> 16:47.445
It couldn't be…

169
16:48.863 --> 16:50.072
Prince Heinrey?

170
16:52.408 --> 16:53.743
I don't believe it.

171
16:57.538 --> 16:58.873
No, surely not.

172
16:58.956 --> 17:00.916
[chirping]

173
17:03.169 --> 17:05.171
[Navier] "I did attend the New Year's Ceremony,

174
17:05.254 --> 17:07.381
"but regrettably, I am a man."

175
17:07.465 --> 17:08.466
[chirps]

176
17:09.842 --> 17:10.843
[chuckles softly]

177
17:12.178 --> 17:13.387
This way, I'm hidden.

178
17:13.971 --> 17:15.348
What do you think?

179
17:15.431 --> 17:17.683
Now he won't discover my identity.

180
17:17.767 --> 17:18.934
-[chirps] -[chuckles softly]

181
17:19.018 --> 17:20.853
[♪ calming music playing]

182
17:20.936 --> 17:22.355
Your master's intriguing.

183
17:23.064 --> 17:24.398
I'd like to know him more.

184
17:25.649 --> 17:26.984
And I wish dearly

185
17:27.568 --> 17:29.987
that I could win this bet so you were mine.

186
17:31.030 --> 17:32.031
[chirps]

187
17:39.246 --> 17:42.416
However, my position will not allow such freedom.

188
17:51.258 --> 17:53.010
-[Queen screeches] -[♪ music continues]

189
17:57.264 --> 17:58.557
[whooshing]

190
18:14.198 --> 18:15.324
[Heinrey sighs]

191
18:17.201 --> 18:19.203
[♪ soft music playing]

192
18:19.870 --> 18:23.749
"A fate that had lost its way found me, and now I send it back."

193
18:23.833 --> 18:24.875
[huffs]

194
18:24.959 --> 18:28.045
"Come to think of it, the bird's eyes are the same purple as the…

195
18:29.964 --> 18:31.841
"flower petals."

196
18:33.134 --> 18:34.593
No wonder…

197
18:36.470 --> 18:39.515
The look in your eyes while you were dancing was rather intense.

198
18:40.099 --> 18:42.643
It turns out you were out searching for your "fate,"

199
18:42.727 --> 18:45.438
when I thought you were just out scouting.

200
18:48.149 --> 18:49.817
Sort your clothes out, will you?

201
18:49.900 --> 18:51.652
Don't speak of my "fate" looking like that.

202
18:51.736 --> 18:53.612
-[zipper zips loudly] -[chuckles]

203
18:54.238 --> 18:55.281
Is it true?

204
18:55.865 --> 18:57.032
Don't tell me that you…

205
18:57.783 --> 18:58.784
You…

206
18:58.868 --> 19:00.119
have feelings for her?

207
19:00.202 --> 19:01.370
Empress Navier?

208
19:01.454 --> 19:03.748
You honestly have to tell me the truth immediately.

209
19:05.750 --> 19:09.044
Now, if I'm honest about how I feel,

210
19:09.128 --> 19:11.338
I worry that you would cry.

211
19:11.422 --> 19:12.798
Uh, cry?

212
19:12.882 --> 19:14.759
What exactly are you saying to me right now?

213
19:15.342 --> 19:16.510
What?

214
19:16.594 --> 19:17.887
Your Highness,

215
19:17.970 --> 19:20.973
if you want a romance which is serious, I am all for it.

216
19:21.056 --> 19:23.225
However, if that woman is her…

217
19:23.309 --> 19:27.104
If you've fallen in love with the Empress, then that is another problem altogether.

218
19:27.188 --> 19:30.065
She's the empress of a powerful empire!

219
19:30.149 --> 19:32.610
Even if it was a tiny little empire, it's still an issue.

220
19:32.693 --> 19:34.820
How could you do this to me? I am mortified!

221
19:34.904 --> 19:36.906
Surely you wouldn't want to become entangled

222
19:36.989 --> 19:39.366
in a scandal of passion with the Eastern Empire?

223
19:41.535 --> 19:42.745
Oh, wouldn't I?

224
19:45.706 --> 19:48.876
It looks as though the Emperor has fallen for another.

225
19:48.959 --> 19:50.044
Now then…

226
19:50.127 --> 19:52.588
the Empress surely wouldn't embrace and forgive this.

227
19:53.839 --> 19:56.258
And that is because she could leave him for me instead…

228
19:56.342 --> 19:58.260
Even if the Emperor has fallen for another,

229
19:58.344 --> 20:00.137
she is only the man's mistress.

230
20:00.221 --> 20:02.723
Do you think the Empress, who possesses this great empire,

231
20:02.807 --> 20:04.892
would divorce her husband over a single mistress?

232
20:04.975 --> 20:06.310
And the Emperor, too.

233
20:06.393 --> 20:08.562
Do you think he would cast aside an Empress

234
20:08.646 --> 20:09.980
praised by all the other kingdoms?

235
20:10.064 --> 20:12.650
Will he raise a runaway slave to the heights of Empress?

236
20:12.733 --> 20:17.279
Well, the fact that another woman could catch his eye at all,

237
20:17.363 --> 20:20.074
even though Navier is amazing, it proves he's insane.

238
20:20.157 --> 20:21.784
Uh, no. Out of everyone…

239
20:21.867 --> 20:23.744
Out of all the great people of this Empire

240
20:23.828 --> 20:25.830
and all the guests who attended the New Year's Ceremony,

241
20:25.913 --> 20:28.415
the craziest of all, Prince Heinrey, it's you.

242
20:28.958 --> 20:32.086
[gasps and sighs melodramatically]

243
20:32.169 --> 20:33.504
Oh, what is this?

244
20:38.384 --> 20:39.385
It was a joke.

245
20:40.678 --> 20:42.596
I was just teasing, so you would cry.

246
20:43.180 --> 20:44.181
Ugh, you were?

247
20:44.265 --> 20:46.475
-Mmm-hmm. -You were! [laughs]

248
20:47.017 --> 20:49.311
Ah, you, you scared me! [chuckles]

249
20:49.395 --> 20:51.480
-Let's prepare the talks. -Yes, Your Highness.

250
20:57.987 --> 20:59.530
[people chattering]

251
21:02.616 --> 21:03.826
[indistinct shouting]

252
21:05.828 --> 21:09.039
EASTERN EMPIRE IMPERIAL GAZETTE PRINCE HEINREY, NEW YEAR'S SENSATION

253
21:09.123 --> 21:11.208
TAKING HIGH SOCIETY BY STORM! MISTRESS RASHTA BOTULIN

254
21:15.504 --> 21:18.924
[woman] To me, Her Majesty the Empress is the most impressive.

255
21:19.008 --> 21:22.678
Someone described her as noble ice, and that is exactly right!

256
21:22.761 --> 21:24.847
-[woman 1 laughs] -[woman 2] Exactly!

257
21:24.930 --> 21:26.765
When I saw her, I froze like ice!

258
21:26.849 --> 21:28.767
Her aura was so overwhelming.

259
21:28.851 --> 21:30.102
-[woman 1] I know what you mean! -[both laugh]

260
21:30.185 --> 21:31.228
MISS RASHTA'S STYLE

261
21:32.980 --> 21:34.690
-[door opens] -[store owner] Okay.

262
21:34.773 --> 21:37.234
-Ah! Did you see it? -Please don't touch that.

263
21:37.318 --> 21:38.903
-It's lovely. -Look with your eyes only.

264
21:40.696 --> 21:42.531
Rashta… this girl…

265
21:42.615 --> 21:43.741
[chuckles]

266
21:45.159 --> 21:46.160
Who is she?

267
21:48.329 --> 21:49.663
What "girl"?

268
21:49.747 --> 21:50.831
She's the mistress.

269
21:51.540 --> 21:54.418
His Majesty the Emperor just acquired her.

270
21:54.501 --> 21:56.128
Rashta Ishka Botulin.

271
21:57.296 --> 21:58.339
A mistress?

272
21:59.006 --> 22:01.216
[laughs maliciously]

273
22:01.300 --> 22:02.301
Really?

274
22:02.885 --> 22:03.886
Ah!

275
22:03.969 --> 22:06.221
[store owner] Here's the item you ordered.

276
22:06.305 --> 22:07.765
[♪ ominous music playing]

277
22:22.529 --> 22:23.572
You've got this!

278
22:24.239 --> 22:26.241
[♪ bright music playing]

279
22:30.204 --> 22:32.873
[maid] The Grand Duchess Albani has arrived.

280
22:35.542 --> 22:36.752
Look at you, child!

281
22:36.835 --> 22:38.504
You grow more radiant by the day.

282
22:39.088 --> 22:42.424
Fortunately, with all these events, I can practice what I've learnt.

283
22:42.508 --> 22:43.968
[Albani] That is fortunate.

284
22:44.051 --> 22:45.970
So, keep enjoying yourself. Ha!

285
22:52.393 --> 22:55.437
Anyone would think she belongs in high society.

286
22:56.230 --> 22:57.439
Keep quiet, girl.

287
22:57.523 --> 23:00.192
Goodness, all the grime washed right off.

288
23:00.275 --> 23:02.194
That expression…

289
23:02.277 --> 23:04.947
Isn't she imitating the Empress?

290
23:05.030 --> 23:07.783
Sometimes, Ms. Rashta is rather disconcerting.

291
23:07.866 --> 23:11.578
It's almost as though her innocence is all an act to bewitch people.

292
23:13.956 --> 23:15.124
What do you think?

293
23:17.376 --> 23:18.961
The Empress, do I look like her?

294
23:19.837 --> 23:23.132
-Oh, you are far more beautiful! -[Kisia] Much more!

295
23:23.215 --> 23:25.551
[all giggling]

296
23:28.470 --> 23:30.889
Oh my! Oh, my goodness!

297
23:30.973 --> 23:33.642
It's so incredibly beautiful!

298
23:33.726 --> 23:36.395
Grand Duke Krom sent me a present. How kind.

299
23:36.478 --> 23:37.479
Oh, did he?

300
23:37.563 --> 23:39.481
You really are building close relationships

301
23:39.565 --> 23:40.607
with the foreign guests lately.

302
23:40.691 --> 23:42.067
You heard right.

303
23:42.151 --> 23:45.320
-Rashta is just adored by all foreigners. -Mmm.

304
23:45.404 --> 23:49.033
A lady said to me that she heard some of the guests say this.

305
23:49.616 --> 23:53.537
"He who moves the world is the Emperor of the Eastern Empire,

306
23:53.620 --> 23:54.788
"and Rashta…

307
23:54.872 --> 23:57.583
"Rashta is the woman who can move that Emperor."

308
23:57.666 --> 23:58.959
-[♪ music stops] -[Rashta giggles]

309
23:59.710 --> 24:00.711
Shh!

310
24:00.794 --> 24:03.255
You mustn't say such things out loud so carelessly.

311
24:03.964 --> 24:05.132
I only said it as a joke.

312
24:05.215 --> 24:07.468
[scoffs] It is not a joke in the slightest.

313
24:07.551 --> 24:10.387
There would be serious trouble if the court heard.

314
24:12.473 --> 24:14.683
Oh. I'll remember those words.

315
24:16.185 --> 24:17.186
Oh, well…

316
24:17.686 --> 24:20.856
I suppose as long as it has no direct connection to the Emperor,

317
24:21.440 --> 24:23.150
then it is a very good thing.

318
24:23.233 --> 24:25.277
People should talk about you.

319
24:26.987 --> 24:28.530
Oh, I see now.

320
24:28.614 --> 24:29.656
[chuckles softly]

321
24:30.282 --> 24:31.825
Today, at last,

322
24:31.909 --> 24:34.787
the invitations to your banquet are ready!

323
24:34.870 --> 24:35.954
[♪ bright music playing]

324
24:36.038 --> 24:37.206
[squeals happily]

325
24:42.961 --> 24:43.962
[continues squealing]

326
24:44.046 --> 24:45.839
[both squealing, laughing]

327
24:48.092 --> 24:52.387
"We invite you to the banquet of Rashta Ishka Botulin."

328
24:52.471 --> 24:54.264
[gasps] Oh!

329
24:54.348 --> 24:55.599
Do you think people will go?

330
24:56.183 --> 24:57.976
Oh, my goodness! I'm so nervous!

331
24:58.060 --> 25:00.646
-[laughing] -[Albani chuckles awkwardly]

332
25:00.729 --> 25:02.940
[Philomena] The noble ladies are gasping for attention

333
25:03.023 --> 25:04.983
from the guests at the West Palace.

334
25:05.067 --> 25:06.902
[Albani] Poor little Rashta, she's so excited,

335
25:06.985 --> 25:09.321
but this banquet won't amount to much.

336
25:09.947 --> 25:11.448
The noble ladies…

337
25:11.532 --> 25:13.575
-they won't dare attend. -[♪ ominous music playing]

338
25:13.659 --> 25:15.494
It would be the ultimate betrayal.

339
25:16.245 --> 25:18.080
And the Empress still has their loyalty.

340
25:18.789 --> 25:21.625
Abandoning her because they were swayed by some fleeting rumor?

341
25:21.708 --> 25:23.585
Honestly… They won't do that.

342
25:24.169 --> 25:27.047
Then why did you say you would hold a banquet for Ms. Rashta?

343
25:27.756 --> 25:29.049
If the company is lacking,

344
25:29.133 --> 25:31.885
the Botulin House will suffer a blow as well.

345
25:31.969 --> 25:34.304
We are finally regaining entry into high society

346
25:34.388 --> 25:36.515
after being barred for 15 years.

347
25:36.598 --> 25:38.392
The pieces are all set for us.

348
25:38.475 --> 25:39.643
Finally, we can join the game.

349
25:43.021 --> 25:44.857
You know what our goal is.

350
25:44.940 --> 25:47.025
It is not to elevate Rashta.

351
25:48.527 --> 25:50.654
It is Navier's complete torment.

352
25:50.737 --> 25:53.907
To destroy that woman's soul and her glowing reputation with it.

353
25:54.908 --> 25:56.785
We will isolate her entirely.

354
25:56.869 --> 25:58.245
[♪ soft music playing]

355
26:09.882 --> 26:11.258
[rattling]

356
26:13.177 --> 26:14.845
[screeches]

357
26:16.513 --> 26:18.182
Oh! [laughs]

358
26:20.434 --> 26:21.435
[chirps]

359
26:22.019 --> 26:23.562
[chuckles] Queen!

360
26:23.645 --> 26:25.189
He's so funny.

361
26:25.272 --> 26:26.273
He flew over that way,

362
26:26.356 --> 26:27.941
and when he saw you were changing, Your Majesty…

363
26:28.025 --> 26:31.361
he got so startled and scrambled hurriedly to turn his back!

364
26:31.445 --> 26:32.446
[Eliza] I saw it, too.

365
26:32.529 --> 26:35.616
He looked ashamed, almost. But that's silly, isn't it?

366
26:35.699 --> 26:37.201
[Laura] Yes, I know!

367
26:38.410 --> 26:39.494
[chuckles softly]

368
26:39.578 --> 26:41.288
You can look now, I'm decent.

369
26:46.752 --> 26:48.045
[Navier chuckles]

370
26:48.754 --> 26:50.339
Oh, did that make you shy?

371
26:50.422 --> 26:51.924
[chirping]

372
26:55.385 --> 26:57.095
[chirping]

373
27:02.309 --> 27:04.436
[Heinrey] "Are you even searching for me?"

374
27:18.033 --> 27:19.534
[Navier] "I'm searching hard.

375
27:19.618 --> 27:21.662
[♪ serene, enthralling music playing]

376
27:27.417 --> 27:28.502
"And you?

377
27:33.215 --> 27:34.216
"Are you looking for me?"

378
27:39.096 --> 27:43.225
I'M SEARCHING HARD. AND YOU? ARE YOU LOOKING FOR ME?

379
28:04.287 --> 28:06.289
[♪ music continues]

380
28:33.525 --> 28:34.818
[McKenna] Wow!

381
28:35.402 --> 28:38.363
These Eastern Empire rascals did a great job with the place.

382
28:38.447 --> 28:40.240
Have you visited the pond out there yet?

383
28:40.323 --> 28:42.909
The landscaping, ah, stunning!

384
28:42.993 --> 28:45.120
And my goodness, out front! Is it a lake?

385
28:45.203 --> 28:46.621
Is it the sea, perhaps?

386
28:46.705 --> 28:47.956
It's massive either way.

387
28:49.583 --> 28:51.334
-[♪ bright, playful music playing] -McKenna!

388
28:51.418 --> 28:52.669
Yes?

389
28:52.753 --> 28:54.546
Who here cannot keep a secret?

390
28:55.130 --> 28:56.256
What was that?

391
28:57.382 --> 28:58.383
A secret?

392
28:58.467 --> 29:00.093
I need something circulating.

393
29:00.177 --> 29:02.471
It needs to be powerful and quick.

394
29:04.222 --> 29:06.099
The ministers of each nation are moving forward

395
29:06.183 --> 29:07.517
with full-scale trade agreements.

396
29:07.601 --> 29:09.019
Our merchants are the most active,

397
29:09.102 --> 29:12.731
and the number of concluded agreements is overwhelmingly high.

398
29:12.814 --> 29:14.566
Which nation has the second-highest trade?

399
29:14.649 --> 29:15.817
The Western Kingdom, Sire.

400
29:16.610 --> 29:18.111
Heinrey…

401
29:19.571 --> 29:21.990
Why did the king send the Prince and not himself?

402
29:22.074 --> 29:23.575
It seems the rumors concerning

403
29:23.658 --> 29:26.787
King Walton III's grave illness are true.

404
29:26.870 --> 29:29.206
He swore he would punish us one day…

405
29:29.915 --> 29:33.085
because of all the humiliation he suffered at our hand.

406
29:33.168 --> 29:35.378
Since he has no heirs with Queen Krista,

407
29:35.462 --> 29:39.091
it appears Prince Heinrey will succeed to the throne as first in line.

408
29:39.174 --> 29:41.760
Huh. Wasn't there also a matter of negotiation?

409
29:41.843 --> 29:45.180
Ah, there is a request for talks on the port issue.

410
29:45.263 --> 29:48.308
We still have more of the New Year's Ceremony to attend to.

411
29:49.768 --> 29:51.103
It would be burdensome

412
29:51.186 --> 29:53.355
to discuss with every nation watching.

413
29:53.438 --> 29:54.523
I concur.

414
29:56.858 --> 29:57.859
Let us conclude.

415
29:57.943 --> 30:00.654
I would like to have a discussion with the empress alone.

416
30:00.737 --> 30:02.322
[chairs scraping]

417
30:09.246 --> 30:10.288
[door closes]

418
30:11.081 --> 30:12.374
[Sovieshu sighs]

419
30:14.126 --> 30:15.377
It's about Rashta.

420
30:16.086 --> 30:20.298
I hear the Botulin House is holding a banquet in her honor.

421
30:20.841 --> 30:22.008
I heard, Your Majesty.

422
30:23.635 --> 30:25.387
What if you were able to attend it?

423
30:26.471 --> 30:27.806
Would you consider it?

424
30:30.559 --> 30:32.769
Even if the noble ladies wish to accept Rashta,

425
30:32.853 --> 30:36.189
they are reluctant because they are wary of your reaction.

426
30:40.152 --> 30:41.987
I have no plans to attend the banquet.

427
30:42.863 --> 30:44.823
If that is all you wish to say to me,

428
30:45.448 --> 30:46.449
I will take my leave.

429
30:53.498 --> 30:55.500
Were you always such a jealous person?

430
30:56.001 --> 30:57.669
If this is not jealousy,

431
30:59.337 --> 31:00.547
then what is it?

432
31:01.047 --> 31:03.466
You have strength and power as the Empress

433
31:03.550 --> 31:06.303
far beyond anything Rashta could ever hope to match.

434
31:06.386 --> 31:09.431
And yet, you are treating this powerless child

435
31:10.015 --> 31:12.184
as if she were your rival in love.

436
31:12.267 --> 31:13.935
Won't you open your heart to her?

437
31:16.271 --> 31:18.356
[♪ tense music playing]

438
31:20.108 --> 31:21.151
Oh, no.

439
31:22.861 --> 31:24.196
Your Majesty's mistress

440
31:24.946 --> 31:26.656
is no rival of mine.

441
31:27.866 --> 31:29.743
You may deem her precious.

442
31:30.535 --> 31:33.038
Do you expect me to share that sentiment?

443
31:34.414 --> 31:36.208
She is just a stranger to me, sire.

444
31:37.292 --> 31:38.835
And will remain as such.

445
31:39.586 --> 31:41.254
Do not involve me in this.

446
31:42.088 --> 31:44.049
These concerns will remain yours.

447
31:50.305 --> 31:52.265
My line is now drawn.

448
31:53.934 --> 31:55.143
I will hear no more.

449
31:57.812 --> 31:59.272
[scoffs softly]

450
32:00.398 --> 32:02.943
[♪ music intensifies]

451
32:05.654 --> 32:07.113
[clears throat]

452
32:11.660 --> 32:13.286
His Majesty is thirsty.

453
32:13.370 --> 32:14.537
[door closes]

454
32:16.581 --> 32:17.749
-Ah-- -[both sigh contentedly]

455
32:18.708 --> 32:19.876
[clears throat]

456
32:22.212 --> 32:23.296
[loud clattering]

457
32:24.130 --> 32:25.257
Lante!

458
32:25.840 --> 32:27.717
Yes! Yes, Your Majesty.

459
32:27.801 --> 32:30.679
Here, cold water! Cold water is here.

460
32:30.762 --> 32:31.846
[groans softly]

461
32:32.430 --> 32:34.307
[♪ gentle music playing]

462
32:34.391 --> 32:36.268
[woman] Your Majesty.

463
32:40.063 --> 32:42.315
Thank you for coming, Your Majesty.

464
32:42.399 --> 32:44.359
I've brought something for the bazaar.

465
32:44.442 --> 32:46.152
I hope this will suffice.

466
32:52.242 --> 32:53.785
How kind of you.

467
32:53.868 --> 32:55.745
I know the farmers are grateful.

468
32:56.997 --> 32:58.957
The support for the drought is appreciated.

469
33:00.542 --> 33:04.087
As expected, Princess Circe, your party is quite the popular one.

470
33:04.170 --> 33:05.588
Well, Your Majesty is here…

471
33:08.300 --> 33:10.635
and Prince Heinrey has graced us as well.

472
33:10.719 --> 33:12.387
That guarantees success.

473
33:14.180 --> 33:15.640
How fascinating!

474
33:15.724 --> 33:18.893
Wherever the prince goes, a cloud of people always follow.

475
33:18.977 --> 33:20.603
He was already popular,

476
33:20.687 --> 33:23.481
but since the public notice he released, well…

477
33:23.565 --> 33:25.317
now he's even more so.

478
33:25.400 --> 33:26.401
A public notice?

479
33:26.985 --> 33:28.194
Have you not heard?

480
33:29.946 --> 33:31.072
It's very exciting.

481
33:31.614 --> 33:33.450
There's someone in the Eastern Empire

482
33:33.533 --> 33:35.702
who's been exchanging anonymous letters with Prince Heinrey.

483
33:36.286 --> 33:39.831
The South Palace has been ablaze with talk of it since this morning.

484
33:39.914 --> 33:42.083
He's desperate to find that person no matter what,

485
33:42.667 --> 33:43.710
even publicly if he must,

486
33:44.294 --> 33:46.463
and has asked people to spread the word.

487
33:46.546 --> 33:48.340
[♪ soft, heart-fluttering music playing]

488
34:00.226 --> 34:01.436
Are you quite well?

489
34:01.519 --> 34:02.896
[noblewoman] Princess Circe!

490
34:04.731 --> 34:05.732
One moment.

491
34:06.483 --> 34:08.526
[chuckles] You're here!

492
34:10.862 --> 34:14.240
[Laura] Your Majesty, don't you think the master of that messenger bird

493
34:14.324 --> 34:15.742
might be Prince Heinrey?

494
34:15.825 --> 34:17.827
I had exactly the same idea.

495
34:17.911 --> 34:20.205
[Verdi] He's talking about you, Your Majesty.

496
34:20.288 --> 34:22.123
You should speak to him right away.

497
34:22.207 --> 34:23.917
Prince Heinrey will be delighted

498
34:24.000 --> 34:27.045
to find out that you were his correspondent, Your Majesty.

499
34:27.629 --> 34:29.923
And after all, he did ask you for a dance.

500
34:37.555 --> 34:40.850
It's prudent for me to stay an anonymous friend.

501
34:41.810 --> 34:42.852
But then…

502
34:42.936 --> 34:46.022
He is surrounded by many scandals involving women,

503
34:46.106 --> 34:47.857
so remaining cautious is wise.

504
34:47.941 --> 34:52.070
The people on the other side are already inventing groundless rumors.

505
34:52.153 --> 34:55.490
If it comes to light that Her Majesty has been privately exchanging letters

506
34:55.573 --> 34:56.616
with the prince…

507
34:56.699 --> 35:01.162
Ah. I suppose it would be like a pack of wolves tearing into their prey.

508
35:01.246 --> 35:02.455
[Verdi] But it's just…

509
35:03.206 --> 35:04.916
it's just such a pity.

510
35:07.293 --> 35:08.920
Please do enjoy yourselves.

511
35:09.546 --> 35:12.507
I'll be searching for a present for my mother.

512
35:12.590 --> 35:13.758
Yes.

513
35:15.593 --> 35:17.095
[Laura sighs]

514
35:17.178 --> 35:18.847
This is so upsetting.

515
35:18.930 --> 35:20.849
And so infuriating as well.

516
35:20.932 --> 35:22.016
It's not fair.

517
35:22.517 --> 35:23.852
Ah, I'm sorry, but…

518
35:23.935 --> 35:27.689
it's His Majesty having an affair, it's not Her Majesty's fault at all.

519
35:27.772 --> 35:30.358
And yet malicious rumors surround her instead.

520
35:30.442 --> 35:32.861
Those people, they do whatever they please,

521
35:32.944 --> 35:35.530
but Her Majesty has to be careful.

522
35:35.613 --> 35:38.742
She's innocent. It's that Rashta woman's fault.

523
35:38.825 --> 35:41.077
I just… hate her so much.

524
35:41.661 --> 35:42.912
No! Is it really?

525
35:42.996 --> 35:45.540
-Yes, I'm telling you! -[laughs] No way!

526
35:46.166 --> 35:47.167
I know.

527
35:47.250 --> 35:49.753
It's not certain, so keep it to yourself.

528
35:49.836 --> 35:50.879
-All right? Shh! -All right.

529
35:52.464 --> 35:54.382
Heinrey the Prince and Her Majesty…

530
35:54.466 --> 35:55.800
-[speaks indistinctly] -All right.

531
35:55.884 --> 35:57.010
Yes, all right.

532
35:57.093 --> 35:58.553
-Oh! You're back! -[Kisia] You're back!

533
36:02.807 --> 36:04.058
[Rashta sighs heavily]

534
36:04.976 --> 36:06.019
This is hard.

535
36:06.102 --> 36:08.396
[chuckles] Did you enjoy yourself?

536
36:08.480 --> 36:09.647
How was the banquet?

537
36:09.731 --> 36:13.485
[sighs] The men talked about war, so it was a bit boring.

538
36:14.569 --> 36:17.489
I heard people saying today's banquet was more enjoyable

539
36:17.572 --> 36:19.908
because Prince Heinrey brought an amusing story with him.

540
36:19.991 --> 36:21.493
Was that not true?

541
36:22.160 --> 36:25.872
Well, if it was a party Prince Heinrey had been to, it would have.

542
36:26.456 --> 36:27.999
That would have been fun.

543
36:28.082 --> 36:29.918
With loads more guests, too.

544
36:31.586 --> 36:35.548
[sighs] I only hope people will come to Rashta's party as well.

545
36:35.632 --> 36:37.050
I'm worried.

546
36:37.133 --> 36:42.013
What if it's empty like Duke Ristore's and becomes a total failure?

547
36:46.017 --> 36:47.018
So then…

548
36:47.560 --> 36:48.937
these amusing things.

549
36:49.020 --> 36:51.064
You must tell me everything that was said.

550
36:51.147 --> 36:52.190
Here is what I've heard.

551
36:52.273 --> 36:54.317
There's someone in the Eastern Empire

552
36:54.400 --> 36:56.736
with whom he has been exchanging secret letters.

553
36:56.820 --> 36:58.738
Ooh! Romantic!

554
36:58.822 --> 37:01.658
But he's been searching for the person he exchanged letters with,

555
37:01.741 --> 37:03.493
and no one has come forward yet,

556
37:03.576 --> 37:05.495
and he's terribly anxious about it all.

557
37:06.079 --> 37:07.455
Is that so?

558
37:08.373 --> 37:09.666
A lady…

559
37:10.250 --> 37:14.170
whose face, name, and status he doesn't know.

560
37:15.880 --> 37:18.758
They say the person he's writing to

561
37:18.842 --> 37:21.219
could even be Her Majesty the Empress herself!

562
37:21.302 --> 37:23.179
We were just talking about it.

563
37:23.263 --> 37:24.597
Hey!

564
37:24.681 --> 37:26.307
-What? -[♪ ominous music playing]

565
37:26.391 --> 37:28.059
It might not be true.

566
37:30.019 --> 37:31.229
What are you both saying?

567
37:35.817 --> 37:37.151
[hesitatingly] Well…

568
37:39.863 --> 37:41.155
I heard it, too.

569
37:41.239 --> 37:42.991
It's just I have this cousin…

570
37:43.658 --> 37:46.286
He works at the Western Palace, and apparently…

571
37:46.369 --> 37:52.000
a bird flew to Her Majesty with a letter tied to its ankle.

572
37:54.544 --> 37:55.920
Uh-huh…

573
37:59.591 --> 38:03.261
Please can you find out what was written on all of the letters?

574
38:03.344 --> 38:05.680
MARCHIONESS HELENA DE MONTCLAIR CIRCE ILONA LIAN

575
38:13.146 --> 38:14.856
[clicks, clatters]

576
38:36.044 --> 38:37.545
Are you enjoying your stay?

577
38:38.671 --> 38:40.214
Yes, I am, thank you.

578
38:40.298 --> 38:42.258
It's lovely, thanks to you, Your Majesty.

579
38:42.800 --> 38:43.801
That's wonderful.

580
38:44.802 --> 38:46.971
I heard there's someone you're searching for.

581
38:48.348 --> 38:49.349
Yes.

582
38:50.058 --> 38:52.435
I very much wish to find them.

583
38:54.270 --> 38:56.481
Why is their discovery so important?

584
38:57.774 --> 38:59.067
You have many friends.

585
38:59.609 --> 39:00.693
They dote on you.

586
39:01.277 --> 39:03.321
You're always surrounded by people.

587
39:05.156 --> 39:06.699
You can still feel lonely…

588
39:07.617 --> 39:09.035
even if you're surrounded.

589
39:11.371 --> 39:13.373
You already know that, Your Majesty.

590
39:25.093 --> 39:27.428
If you are sharing your thoughts through these letters…

591
39:28.763 --> 39:30.098
why meet at all?

592
39:32.558 --> 39:34.352
-They are too special. -[♪ yearning music playing]

593
39:34.435 --> 39:35.937
I must meet that person.

594
39:40.525 --> 39:42.026
I pray they feel the same.

595
39:44.153 --> 39:47.156
I've never before revealed my true feelings without pretense.

596
39:49.867 --> 39:53.287
It was also nice to let my guard down and share jokes.

597
39:54.580 --> 39:55.581
I've never…

598
39:56.833 --> 39:58.793
felt my heart flutter like that.

599
40:01.546 --> 40:02.588
These letters…

600
40:03.631 --> 40:06.092
they are precious, and so is their author.

601
40:07.301 --> 40:08.678
I have to meet them.

602
40:16.561 --> 40:18.563
[♪ music continues]

603
41:15.119 --> 41:16.454
[♪ music continues]

604
41:32.220 --> 41:33.596
[gentle chiming]

605
41:41.521 --> 41:42.647
[sighs]

606
41:42.730 --> 41:45.274
[♪ captivating music playing]

607
42:02.583 --> 42:04.627
[♪ music swells]

608
42:34.407 --> 42:35.950
[♪ music continues]

609
43:24.624 --> 43:26.375
[♪ music slows down]

610
43:33.841 --> 43:35.593
[♪ music fades]

611
43:43.684 --> 43:45.686
[♪ gentle music playing]

612
43:48.522 --> 43:49.565
[clinking softly]

613
44:05.623 --> 44:06.749
[exhales softly]

614
44:14.548 --> 44:15.925
[♪ music continues]

615
44:33.818 --> 44:35.236
[inhales deeply]

616
44:35.319 --> 44:36.362
Ah!

617
44:36.445 --> 44:37.530
[chuckles softly]

618
44:39.949 --> 44:42.785
Your tea is getting cold. Will you come and drink it?

619
44:43.286 --> 44:44.495
[sighs heavily]

620
44:47.456 --> 44:49.959
[exasperated sigh] I'm not letting mine go cold.

621
44:51.502 --> 44:52.962
[knock on door]

622
44:55.256 --> 44:57.216
Yes, come in.

623
44:59.468 --> 45:00.594
[door closes]

624
45:00.678 --> 45:03.681
There is someone waiting for Prince Heinrey in the lobby.

625
45:06.642 --> 45:07.643
Who is it?

626
45:07.727 --> 45:09.603
"A fate that was lost," Majesty.

627
45:09.687 --> 45:10.730
[♪ exciting music playing]

628
45:10.813 --> 45:11.814
Oh?

629
45:12.481 --> 45:13.524
Wha…

630
45:14.400 --> 45:16.569
-Your Highness? What? -[Heinrey] Where did it go? McKenna!

631
45:16.652 --> 45:18.029
[McKenna] What's that? What are you looking for?

632
45:18.112 --> 45:19.113
-Why-- -McKenna, where is it?

633
45:19.196 --> 45:20.406
-Whoa, whoa, whoa. -You know the jacket.

634
45:20.489 --> 45:21.532
-The gold jacket? -Oh!

635
45:21.615 --> 45:22.825
Yes, you know the one that's… And that's…

636
45:22.908 --> 45:24.035
-The one that's a lot? -Right!

637
45:24.118 --> 45:25.161
-The gappy one, ah! -Yes.

638
45:25.244 --> 45:26.454
At the end, on the right.

639
45:27.079 --> 45:28.205
Go and get it.

640
45:28.289 --> 45:29.707
-[McKenna] Argh! -Let's go.

641
45:29.790 --> 45:32.335
It's a wonder you can even wash your own face, honestly.

642
45:33.127 --> 45:34.337
-[knocks on door] -[noblewoman] Come out!

643
45:34.420 --> 45:35.629
Prince Heinrey's letter friend is here!

644
45:35.713 --> 45:37.214
Prince Heinrey's letter friend has appeared!

645
45:37.298 --> 45:38.883
Prince Heinrey's letter friend has come.

646
45:38.966 --> 45:40.259
Everyone, come on out!

647
45:40.343 --> 45:42.636
[♪ music intensifies]

648
46:05.034 --> 46:06.494
[footsteps approaching]

649
46:08.662 --> 46:11.207
[nobleman] Don't you think Prince Heinrey is so dashing?

650
46:11.290 --> 46:12.333
[exhales]

651
46:13.084 --> 46:14.585
[noblewoman] Look at that jacket!

652
46:18.005 --> 46:19.173
[exhales]

653
46:27.848 --> 46:29.850
[♪ dramatic music playing]

654
46:47.243 --> 46:50.204
Your Highness, I heard that you have searched ardently.

655
46:52.581 --> 46:54.917
I am the secret pen pal you've been writing to.

656
46:55.793 --> 46:58.379
Your "lost fate", and you found me now.

657
46:59.338 --> 47:01.382
[♪ music continues]

658
47:07.638 --> 47:09.140
[crowd clapping]

659
47:10.724 --> 47:12.726
[♪ music swells]

660
47:24.321 --> 47:26.574
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

661
47:27.032 --> 47:28.033
[♪ music fades]

662
47:29.535 --> 47:31.537
[♪ closing theme music playing]
